: Even More Flame Free (Part 2)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-2/273731","site":"T Nation · 8490 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Things That Piss You Off","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/things-that-piss-you-off/163775","site":"T Nation · 7426 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Rising From the Ashes (CL)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/rising-from-the-ashes-cl/233718","site":"T Nation · 6788 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Things That Make You Chuckle","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/things-that-make-you-chuckle/240079","site":"T Nation · 6256 posts · 2018"},{"title":"The Tactical Life","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Religion Catch All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/religion-catch-all/268570","site":"T Nation · 2730 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Begin...The Rest is Easy","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/begin-the-rest-is-easy/263586","site":"T Nation · 2314 posts · 2019"},{"title":"The War on Drugs","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-war-on-drugs/265165","site":"T Nation · 1909 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Kettlebells Clean and Press, one meal per day","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/kettlebells-clean-and-press-one-meal-per-day/291478","site":"T Nation · 1264 posts · 2025"},{"title":"Men and Women, Women and Men","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/men-and-women-women-and-men/264247","site":"T Nation · 1234 posts · 2020"},{"title":"The Dating Thread","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-dating-thread/275759","site":"T Nation · 1209 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Layman' Training Log/Diary - Bodybuilding - (Red Pill/Blue Pill)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/layman-training-log-diary-bodybuilding-red-pill-blue-pill/263454","site":"T Nation · 1064 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Heavy Metal Thread (and Associated Genres)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/heavy-metal-thread-and-associated-genres/270342","site":"T Nation · 984 posts · 2020"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"CDC Confirms a THC Additive, Vitamin E Acetate, Is Culprit in Most Vaping Deaths","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=21848026","site":"Hacker News","score":244,"comments":163,"year":2019},{"title":"Vaping Illnesses Are Linked to Vitamin E Acetate, CDC Says","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=21491723","site":"Hacker News","score":130,"comments":139,"year":2019},{"title":"FDA is considering drugs to help kids quit vaping","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=18941080","site":"Hacker News","score":61,"comments":193,"year":2019}],"web":[{"title":"Smoker's face","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face"},{"title":"Tobacco smoking","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobacco_smoking"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Anti-aging","chain":["Stop smoking or vaping","Better skin oxygenation and collagen","Fewer wrinkles, healthier skin tone"],"effect":"indirect","text":"Appearance communities cite quitting to slow premature skin aging, since smoking degrades collagen, narrows blood vessels and leaves a wrinkled, sallow smoker's face. The face is well documented; observational data show it is less common in former smokers, though reversal is thinly studied."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Quitting smoking or vaping is a practice appearance communities cite for reducing premature skin aging. Smoker's face describes facial changes seen in smokers, including a characteristic wrinkle pattern and sallow grey skin tone.[1]","A 1985 BMJ study by D. Model reported certain facial features in about 46% of continuing smokers and 8% of former smokers who had smoked for a decade.[1] Proposed mechanisms include raised matrix metalloproteinases degrading collagen and elastin, vasoconstriction and oxidative stress.[1] The sources reviewed do not address vaping and skin."],"infobox":[["Type","Lifestyle / cessation"],["Appearance claim","Less skin aging"],["Term","Smoker's face[1]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Smoker's face","paras":["Smoking is classed as an extrinsic aging factor. It lowers oxygen delivery to skin, depletes antioxidants such as vitamin C and impairs enzymes that clear matrix debris, leaving skin thinner and sagging.[1] Smoking is also linked to hair loss, gum disease and tooth staining.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Quitting","paras":["Lung cancer risk begins falling soon after quitting and drops about 50% after 10 years; about 70% of smokers intend to quit, while 3 to 5% succeed.[2] Whether facial changes reverse after quitting is not addressed in the sources reviewed, which report only that the features were far less common in former smokers.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Use in looksmaxxing","paras":["Quitting is mentioned in skin-aging and health routines. No appearance outcome data on vaping cessation were found."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found on quitting vaping for appearance. For smoking, one observational study compared facial features of current, former and non-smokers.[1]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1985","event":"Model publishes 'Smoker's face: an underrated clinical sign?' in the BMJ.[1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Smoker's face","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Tobacco smoking","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobacco_smoking","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Smoker's face","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"vaping and nicotine is a wonder drug","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-and-nicotine-is-a-wonder-drug.1597435/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251117041002/https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-and-nicotine-is-a-wonder-drug.1597435/"},{"title":"Vaping is the ultimate lean maxing method","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-is-the-ultimate-lean-maxing-method.1575043/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/2